{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.fever",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她烧得有点迷糊",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.fever",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.fever",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──所以，那天的拍摄，说是摄影棚换了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "保险起见，我把换过之后的棚的地图发给你。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……羽那？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──啊，抱歉，我刚才说到哪了？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！身体不舒服吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯──……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "先量个体温吧。我找找体温计。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……放在哪来着。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不用找啦──……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "来，用手量吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………那就失礼了。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……有热度。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这种感觉，是发烧啊──……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "会不会是上次去「はなタウン」的时候玩太疯了……？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是……是我一直让你这么忙。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "大概是累出来了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……抱歉啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……呵呵，为什么制作人要道歉啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "因为是我的责任。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这么忙，连身体都顾不过来。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "又不是制作人的错──……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总之，我送你回宿舍。能走到车那边吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……啊，不过。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "能扶我到车那边吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "知道了。──来，抓住我。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……制作人，比平时更温柔呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "总觉得，很特别。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯。这种感觉，说不定也不错──……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂。这种事可不能随便说，身体还是好一点才好。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好好休息，快点好起来。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，往车那边走了？",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "好──……"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
